Z||000008||Wolfhound||08-05-2001||09:53 AM||||Tina, I,m not sure about the brand. I had it mixed at an Auto paint and body supply. It's a Suspended vinyl. $20.00 a quart. It really goes on nice. <P>they addusted the color twice with no problem, until we got a dried match.<BR>I'll be by there some time this comming week and get back to you,. They are a PPG and Silken dealer.<p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 08-05-2001).]||||reg||1
